ting","clusterId":-1,"clusterLabel":"dating-specific","sentiment":"mixed","searchTerms":["边界协商","dating","neutral","relaxed","boundary","repair"]},{"id":"syn-control-risk","title":"把控制包装成关心","pattern":"控制风险","situation":"对方要求定位、查手机、强制报备或限制社交。","takeaway":"控制不是爱的证明。优先确认边界；如果拒绝被惩罚，应考虑拉开距离。","emotions":["anger","fear","disgust"],"signals":["control"],"dialogue":[{"speaker":"B","text":"把定位一直开着"},{"speaker":"A","text":"我不太舒服"},{"speaker":"B","text":"你爱我就应该让我查手机"},{"speaker":"A","text":"这不行"}],"source":"letsdate-synthetic","license":"CC0-1.0","scene":"dating","clusterId":-1,"clusterLabel":"dating-specific","sentiment":"mixed","searchTerms":["控制风险","dating","anger","fear","disgust","control"]},{"id":"syn-reassurance-seeking","title":"反复确认对方是否还喜欢自己","pattern":"寻求确认","situation":"一方在缺少明确回应时连续追问关系状态。","takeaway":"直接说明当前投入程度比含糊安抚更有效，也不要用反复试探替代沟通。","emotions":["worried","fear","depress"],"signals":["reassurance"],"dialogue":[{"speaker":"A","text":"你是不是不喜欢我了？"},{"speaker":"B","text":"我最近只是忙"},{"speaker":"A","text":"那你怎么不回我？"},{"speaker":"B","text":"我需要一点时间，但不是想消失"}],"source":"letsdate-synthetic","license":"CC0-1.0","scene":"dating","clusterId":-1,"clusterLabel":"dating-specific","sentiment":"mixed","searchTerms":["寻求确认","dating","worried","fear","depress","reassurance"]},{"id":"syn-breadcrumbing","title":"只给热度不给行动","pattern":"低投入循环","situation":"对方偶尔说想你或以后见面，但持续回避具体安排。","takeaway":"把是否愿意落实一次具体安排作为验证标准，不用口头热度替代行动。","emotions":["positive-other","neutral"],"signals":["closeness","future"],"dialogue":[{"speaker":"B","text":"最近好想你"},{"speaker":"A","text":"那周末见？"},{"speaker":"B","text":"看情况，之后再说"},{"speaker":"A","text":"好"}],"source":"letsdate-synthetic","license":"CC0-1.0","scene":"dating","clusterId":-1,"clusterLabel":"dating-specific","sentiment":"mixed","searchTerms":["低投入循环","dating","positive-other","neutral","closeness","future"]},{"id":"syn-polite-no-interest","title":"礼貌回应但没有双向投入","pattern":"低兴趣信号","situation":"回复礼貌但不追问，不提出替代安排，也不主动开启话题。","takeaway":"礼貌不等于兴趣。停止加码，观察对方是否会主动补位。